  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Uma Sundar is a Vice President who reviewed the standard operating procedures for account opening for retail customers.&lt;SEP&gt;Uma Sundar is identified as the Vice President at Unity Small Finance Bank, who participated in the review of the standard operating procedures on the date of '29/04/2023'.</data>
