  <data key="d2">An individual or entity that opens an account with Unity Small Finance Bank for banking services.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals or entities who hold accounts or use services provided by the bank.&lt;SEP&gt;Customer refers to individuals who utilize the banking services provided by Unity Small Finance Bank, including opening and managing accounts.</data>
