  <data key="d1">drawing</data>
  <data key="d2">[Image Name]word_document_icon
[Image Type]Icon

The image depicts an icon representing a Word document, characterized by a document shape with a stylized 'W' symbol at the top left. The icon conveys the general concept of a Microsoft Word file and is often associated with text editing software. Its visual simplicity and recognizable features make it a common representation for documents created in Word.</data>
