<node id="Standard Operating Procedures">
  <data key="d0">Standard Operating Procedures</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A set of operational guidelines pertaining to retail customer account opening.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Operating Procedures are documented processes that outline the steps and responsibilities involved in performing specific tasks, in this case related to retail customer account openings at Unity Small Finance Bank.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) are documented processes and guidelines recommended by personnel within Unity Small Finance Bank for account opening procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Operating Procedures refer to established guidelines for account opening processes tailored for retail customers at Unity Small Finance Bank.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) are documented processes to ensure consistency in operations related to account opening for retail customers at Unity Small Finance Bank.&lt;SEP&gt;The established procedures outlining the steps and requirements for retail account opening, including compliance measures for customer risk categorization.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-012</data>
