The table outlines the version and change control details for the Standard Operating Procedures (SOP) document related to Account Opening for Retail Customers at Unity Small Finance Bank. It consists of six rows and two columns, with the first column serving as the descriptor for key attributes and the second column providing specific information related to each attribute. The attributes include 'SOP / Document Name', 'Last Review Date', 'Owner / Owner Department', 'Version No', and 'Release Date'. The document name explicitly states that it pertains to standard operating procedures for retail customer account opening, indicating its focus on operational guidelines. The last review date is recorded as '23/06/2025', with the version number noted as '1.6', suggesting that the document is relatively recent and has undergone multiple revisions. The release date is set for '24/06/2025', indicating the document is pending release. The owner of the document is listed as 'Consumer Banking', which reflects the department responsible for the SOP. The table effectively functions as a control mechanism for document management, ensuring clarity on versioning and review timelines. It directly supports the context of the leading and trailing text noting the relevance of this SOP within the framework of Unity Small Finance Bank's internal policies.</data>
