The table outlines the individuals involved in the preparation of Standard Operating Procedures for account opening for retail customers at Unity Small Finance Bank. It consists of five rows, each representing a different contributor along with their designation, date of contribution, and signature. The first row contains a merged header spanning four columns labeled 'Standard Operating Procedures Prepared By', indicating the overall purpose of the table. The subsequent rows detail the contributors: Swapnil Bhagwat, an Executive, contributed on February 15, 2023; Deepa Vanjari, a Senior Executive, on March 10, 2023; Gauri Bhosle, also a Senior Executive, on February 15, 2024; Pranjal Dhoke and Medha Walimbe, noted as Assistant Manager and Senior Manager respectively, contributed on October 31, 2024; and finally Ajay Salvi, a Manager, contributed on April 25, 2025. Notably, all signature fields are empty, indicating that these contributions may not have been formally signed off. The table does not include any totals or averages, focusing solely on the contributors' relevant information.</data>
