This table presents a log of Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) recommended by various personnel at Unity Small Finance Bank for the internal process of account opening for retail customers. The table consists of a single header that is merged across four columns, indicating that the following data pertains specifically to the recommendations made. The first row of the table includes the column headers: 'Name', 'Designation', 'Date', and 'Signature'. The data rows contain entries for individuals, detailing their names, designations, and the respective dates on which the SOPs were recommended. Notably, Manjusha Nimkar appears twice with different dates, indicating ongoing involvement in the procedure. The dates range from April 15, 2023, to April 25, 2025, suggesting that the recommendations are part of an evolving protocol, possibly due to regulatory or operational changes. There are empty cells in the 'Signature' column, indicating that the SOPs have yet to be formally approved or signed off. The presence of a row with only a date but no associated name or designation highlights a potential outlier or incomplete entry that may require follow-up. Overall, the table illustrates the contributions of various staff members towards the SOPs and emphasizes the continuity of updates leading into 2025.</data>
