  <data key="d2">[Table Name]sop_revision_updates

This table presents updates to the Standard Operating Procedures (SOP) for Retail Account Opening at Unity Small Finance Bank, focusing on customer risk categorization and process enhancements. The rows document specific revisions, with each revision identified by a version number in the first column. The second column provides details about the modifications made, including the removal of requirements for high-risk customer approvals and the addition of KYC documentation protocols for joint account holders, reflecting compliance with audit requirements. Dates in the third column signify when these updates were documented: the first update on February 16, 2024, and the second on March 25, 2025. The absence of values in the fourth column suggests no additional comments or notes for these entries. The updates aim to align with regulatory changes and internal compliance standards, demonstrating a commitment to improving customer due diligence processes. Overall, the table encapsulates significant procedural changes mandated by both internal audits and external regulatory guidance.</data>
