<node id="Unity Small Finance Bank">
  <data key="d0">Unity Small Finance Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unity Small Finance Bank is a financial institution that offers a wide range of banking services targeted primarily at retail customers. This bank provides essential financial services, including account opening, customer support, and account management. It places significant emphasis on inclusivity, catering to diverse demographics such as minors and individuals with disabilities, ensuring that various customer needs are met.

The institution engages in Know Your Customer (KYC) processes, customer due diligence, and risk assessment to maintain compliance with regulatory standards. Unity Small Finance Bank implements enhanced due diligence (EDD) practices as part of its customer interaction and banking setup processes. This includes managing accounts for customers categorized as high-risk and conducting thorough compliance checks to uphold regulatory mandates, particularly concerning customer identification and risk management.

Unity Small Finance Bank also has established procedures for account opening and maintaining operational efficiency through standard operating procedures. Its services extend to managing inoperative accounts and overseeing documentation and review processes related to customer accounts. The bank's software interface is equipped with various options that mirror its operational capabilities, further enhancing customer experience.

In summary, Unity Small Finance Bank is dedicated to providing accessible banking services to retail customers while ensuring that regulatory compliance and customer due diligence are meticulously adhered to in all aspects of its operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-drawing-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-drawing-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-drawing-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-020</data>
