  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The domestic account interest rate is defined by the bank according to its policies and is influenced by directives from the Reserve Bank of India.</data>
  <data key="d10">defined by</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Non-Resident Ordinary Account" target="Interest Rate">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The interest rate for Non-Resident Ordinary Accounts is determined by the bank's policies and may vary according to specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d10">subject to</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Non-Resident External Account" target="Interest Rate">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The interest rate for Non-Resident External Accounts is set by the bank and is dependent on regulatory guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d10">subject to</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Interest Rate" target="Deposits">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The interest rate on deposits is determined by the bank according to its policy and regulatory requirements.</data>
  <data key="d10">determined by</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Interest Rate" target="Term Deposit Account">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Interest Rate applicable to the Term Deposit Account is defined by the Bank based on the terms agreed upon at the time of deposit.</data>
  <data key="d10">defined by,subject to</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Term Deposit" target="Minimum Tenor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Term Deposit requires a Minimum Tenor, which is specified by RBI regulations to qualify for interest payments.</data>
  <data key="d10">requires,specified by</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Term Deposit Account" target="Maturity Date">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Term Deposit Account has a Maturity Date, which indicates when the funds will be payable along with interest.</data>
  <data key="d10">has,occurs on</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NRE Deposits" target="Scheduled Commercial Banks">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NRE Deposits are regulated by Scheduled Commercial Banks which offer these accounts to non-resident Indians.</data>
  <data key="d10">Banking,Regulation</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="NRO Deposits" target="Scheduled Commercial Banks">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">NRO Deposits are managed by Scheduled Commercial Banks to facilitate income management for non-resident Indians.</data>
  <data key="d10">Banking,Regulation</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scheduled Commercial Banks" target="Board of Directors">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Scheduled Commercial Banks are overseen by the Board of Directors, which is responsible for strategic decision-making.</data>
  <data key="d10">Governance,Oversight</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scheduled Commercial Banks" target="Deposit Insurance and Credit Guarantee Corporation of India">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Scheduled Commercial Banks participate in the insurance scheme provided by the Deposit Insurance and Credit Guarantee Corporation of India.</data>
  <data key="d10">Insurance,Protection</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scheduled Commercial Banks" target="Customer Information">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Customer Information is collected and utilized by Scheduled Commercial Banks for cross-selling services and products.</data>
  <data key="d10">Data Management,Services</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scheduled Commercial Banks" target="Dormant Accounts">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Dormant Accounts are classified and managed by Scheduled Commercial Banks according to banking regulations.</data>
  <data key="d10">Account Management,Regulation</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scheduled Commercial Banks" target="Inactive Accounts">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Inactive Accounts are monitored by Scheduled Commercial Banks, which notify the account holders of the status.</data>
  <data key="d10">Account Management,Notification</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d12">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1786696706</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Scheduled Commercial Banks" target="Grievance Redressal Policy">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Scheduled Commercial Banks implement Grievance Redressal Policies to handle customer complaints effectively.</data>
  <data key="d10">complaints,policy,procedures</data>
