<edge source="Standard Operating Procedures" target="Unity Small Finance Bank">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Standard Operating Procedures guidelines are governed by Unity Small Finance Bank.&lt;SEP&gt;The Standard Operating Procedures serve a critical function in documenting the review process for compliance and accountability at Unity Small Finance Bank.&lt;SEP&gt;Unity Small Finance Bank implements Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) for the internal process of account opening for retail customers.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Operating Procedures are utilized within Unity Small Finance Bank to govern the process of account opening for retail customers.</data>
  <data key="d10">compliance,documentation,governed by,implementation,organization,procedures</data>
  <data key="d11">doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e34273750791ef213944c7971a5e5a1-mm-table-004</data>
